A story how even a very careful play wouldn't help you in some cases...
(Some minor spoilers follow)


Running wizard on level 3, still quite wimpy (as normal for wizards on
level 3). I found a wand, tested it by standard methods... Wishing!!!
Now careful, I have a chance for a great game, what do I wish for?...
OK, first charging scrolls, then a decent armor. Then, hm... let's keep
the rest of the wishes for a while, there is a large shop on the level,
will see what I need after checking it. Now, a pet would be very helpful,
but my Kicor was killed on lvl 2 - so, armed with tripe i go down. First
step - and I hit a sleeping gas trap. A wild kitten arrives and kills me
before I can wake up... That's bitter, the kitten I've been looking for...
And those five whishes left... But who would guess that the correct
wish were 3 blessed tins of elf meat?
